<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-7/8 (FIM 261.65).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-7/8 (FIM 261.65).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR rose $0-3/4 to $57-7/8 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 261.65 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday Nokia A closed up 0.50 markka at 259.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) fell $0-1/8 to $32-1/4 on Wall Street on Thursday. The price equals about 72.90 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet fell 1.00 markka to 73.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR rose $0-1/8 to $19 in New York. The price equals about 85.90 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 0.50 markka up at 86.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
